---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="bg-[#0A0A0A] border-t border-[#2D2D2D] pt-20 pb-10">
  <div class="container-custom">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-12 mb-16">
      <!-- Brand -->
      <div>
        <a href="/" class="inline-block mb-6">
          <span class="text-2xl font-playfair font-bold text-gradient">
            TravelAgentIA
          </span>
        </a>
        <p class="text-text-muted italic mb-6">"De agente a agente"</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-text-muted">
          © {currentYear} TravelAgentIA — Fernando Córdoba
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Navigation -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="text-gold-light font-semibold mb-6">Navegación</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          <li><a href="/sobre-mi" class="text-text-muted hover:text-gold-primary transition-colors">Sobre mí</a></li>
          <li><a href="/servicios" class="text-text-muted hover:text-gold-primary transition-colors">Servicios</a></li>
          <li><a href="/casos" class="text-text-muted hover:text-gold-primary transition-colors">Casos reales</a></li>
          <li><a href="/blog" class="text-text-muted hover:text-gold-primary transition-colors">Blog</a></li>
          <li><a href="/cursos" class="text-text-muted hover:text-gold-primary transition-colors">Cursos</a></li>
          <li><a href="/faq" class="text-text-muted hover:text-gold-primary transition-colors">FAQ</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Legal -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="text-gold-light font-semibold mb-6">Legal</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          <li><a href="/aviso-legal" class="text-text-muted hover:text-gold-primary transition-colors">Aviso legal</a></li>
          <li><a href="/privacidad" class="text-text-muted hover:text-gold-primary transition-colors">Política de privacidad</a></li>
          <li><a href="/cookies" class="text-text-muted hover:text-gold-primary transition-colors">Política de cookies</a></li>
          <li>
            <button
              onclick="window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('openCookiePanel'))"
              class="text-text-muted hover:text-gold-primary transition-colors cursor-pointer bg-transparent border-none p-0 font-inherit text-inherit"
            >
              Gestionar cookies
            </button>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Social -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="text-gold-light font-semibold mb-6">Redes sociales</h4>
        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/fernandocordoba" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-bg-border flex items-center justify-center text-text-muted hover:border-gold-primary hover:text-gold-primary transition-all">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 8a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v7h-4v-7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2 2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7h-4v-7a6 6 0 0 1 6-6z"></path><rect width="4" height="12" x="2" y="9"></rect><circle cx="4" cy="4" r="2"></circle></svg>
          </a>
          <a href="https://instagram.com/safetour.es" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-bg-border flex items-center justify-center text-text-muted hover:border-gold-primary hover:text-gold-primary transition-all">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="20" height="20" x="2" y="2" rx="5" ry="5"></rect><path d="M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z"></path><line x1="17.5" x2="17.51" y1="6.5" y2="6.5"></line></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="border-t border-bg-border pt-10 text-center text-xs text-text-muted">
      <p>Diseñado para liderar el sector turístico con Inteligencia Artificial.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
